# Kazaha Faruzan Furina Kokomi. ~20s Rot. Kazuha-Faruzan Quickswap. Kazuha skills off CD with Faruzan aimed shots in between. VV Kazuha - MH Faruzan trails slightly. TTDS lands on Kazuha.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
kazuha char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
kazuha add weapon="wolffang" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
kazuha add set="mh" count=4;
